  "name": "Analysis code and database for \"Non-cereal agroforestry as a globally overlooked reservoir of biodiversity and nutritional diversity\"",
  "description": "R code and curated database used to produce all analyses and figures of a global systematic review of non-cereal agroforestry systems, covering 4,512 paired experiments from 638 studies across 83 countries. Includes the experiment database, the species characteristics table, the ecosystem-service classification, and a README giving the run order and package requirements. No account or login is required to access or run the analysis.",
